  "id": "fs.searchhost",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "title": "移除任务栏搜索 UI 宿主",
  "description": "删除保留包 Client.CBS 内的整个搜索 UI 表面：SearchHost.exe、FESearchHost.exe、SearchUx.* 五个 DLL/winmd、SemanticSearchHelper.dll、Cortana.* 四个 winmd、Cortana.UI\\ 资源目录（含 ConstraintIndex 索引与 WebView 缓存）及 localizedScopeStrings.json / windows-searchbox-dynamic-content.schema.json。任务栏搜索框已由 registry.kiosk-taskbar/首登脚本隐藏，对看盘机无功能损失。v1.1 只删 SearchHost.exe 时 StartMenuExperienceHost 仍按清单激活 CortanaUI，产生 7 条 DCOM 10001（2147942402 目标路径不存在）；v2.0.0 配合 fs.cbs-manifest-strip 把 CortanaUI/CortanaUIFullTrustApp/FESearchUI 激活入口从包清单剥离，DCOM 报错类随之消除。保留 SearchHost 也不可行：2026-10-16 Hyper-V 冒烟（WER 转储实证）它每次启动在 twinapi.appcore.dll 崩溃循环 6 次（stowed exception 0xC000027B），之后才自愈——移除即治本。",
  "category": "Desktop Experience",
  "riskLevel": "Medium",
  "operations": [
    {
      "resource": "fs.path",
      "action": "remove",
      "spec": {
        "paths": [
